---
import Imagen from '../assets/hero.jpg';
---

<section class="text-gray-600 body-font">
  <div class="container mx-auto flex px-5 py-24 md:flex-row flex-col items-center">
    <div class="lg:max-w-lg lg:w-full md:w-1/2 w-5/6 mb-10 md:mb-0">
      <img class="object-cover object-center rounded" alt="hero" src={Imagen.src} />
    </div>
    <div class="lg:flex-grow md:w-1/2 lg:pl-24 md:pl-16 flex flex-col md:items-start md:text-left items-center text-center">
      <h1 class="title-font sm:text-4xl text-3xl mb-4 font-medium text-gray-900">Decisiones,
        <br class="hidden lg:inline-block">no impulsos.
      </h1>
      <p class="mb-8 leading-relaxed">Analisis, disciplina y gestion del riesgo para tomar decisiones informadas.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>